# Build-context allowlist for the fictional staging image.
#
# Copied to the repository root as `.gcloudignore` by the deploy script and
# removed afterwards, so no untracked root file is left behind and nothing
# outside `pilot_runtime/` is committed.
#
# Without this, `gcloud builds submit` uploads the whole repository — which
# here is several GB of PDFs, spreadsheets, notebooks, a tarball and two other
# services. That is slow, and it would put the Parent 2.3 service and the
# therapist service into a build context that has no business seeing them.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-admit only the two packages the image copies.

*
!pilot_backend/
!pilot_backend/**
!pilot_runtime/
!pilot_runtime/**

# Nothing in the image needs these, and tests are deleted in the image anyway.
pilot_backend/tests/**
pilot_runtime/tests/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
